        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an effort to support her sister's future career as a matchmaker, Eiren Reeves agrees to a blind date her sister sets up. Several hours later, when her date's a no show...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The planet is invaded!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But wait... the invader looks rather familiar? No, it couldn't be. There's no way Eiren's date is an alien invader that just put the fate of the world in her hands, right? Unless...?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987620/extras/e8691dcd83fd98a19869ba022761d1cf.webp?t=1779242048\" width=613 height=39 /></span><br><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bestow a name upon the protagonist (technically)!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save earth from an alien overlord using romance!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an hilarious, ending collector rom-com that's over 45,000k words! (Approximately 3 hours of gameplay)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 10 possible endings!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content Warnings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be advised that this game contains depictions of slapstick violence, profanity, and sexually suggestive content. Overall it's rated T for Teen. Player discretion is still advised. </p>",
